<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan rapeseed imports rise 17.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan rapeseed imports rise 17.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's rapeseed imports in January totalled 157,843 tonnes, up 17.5 percent from the same month a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry statistics released on Friday.</p>
<p>The breakdown was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Jan 97	 Dec 96	 Jan 96</p>
<p> Total rapeseed   157,843	132,8571     134,310</p>
<p>Major supplier of rapeseed (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Canada	     152,761	131,593	133,316</p>
<p>Total imports in calendar 1996 were 1.8 million tonnes, versus 1.87 million tonnes a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
</text>
